      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't want to rebuild. i don't have anything left in the tank to even attempt it. it feels like i spent two decades playing a game that was rigged from the start. if the end result of all that work is just being back at zero, why keep playing? it just feels like i'm throwing good time after bad at this point.",
